    {
      "type": "html",
      "id": "pf_cfd8d770_value",
      "label": "Paragraph4 — Value",
      "default": "To keep your brush performing at its best, we recommend the following care steps:\n<br><br>1. Gently remove any hair trapped in the bristles.\n<br><br>2. Clean using warm, soapy water.\n\nRinse thoroughly to remove any residue.\n<br><br>3. Leave to air dry with the bristles facing downward.\n<br><br>Regular cleaning helps maintain hygiene and ensures your brush stays in excellent condition — ready to glide through your hair with ease every time!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_21aaf89c_label",
      "label": "Accordion3.Header — Label",
      "default": "How can I clean my Mane Master™?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_5b59a747_expandText",
      "label": "CompactButton — Expand Text",
      "default": "View more"
