      "id": "pf_faedec5d_value",
      "label": "Paragraph4 — Value",
      "default": "<strong>1. Contact Us:</strong> To be eligible for a return, you must first contact us at info@thesmoothcompany.com. Please include your proof of purchase.\n<br><strong>2. Return Instructions:</strong> If your return is accepted, we will email you instructions on how and where to send your package. Please note that if there is no fault with the product(s), it is the responsibility of the customer to ensure the goods are returned safely to us via a postal or courier service. This cost must be covered by the customer. If a refund is issued, we will refund the monetary value of the goods returned to us, less the delivery charges you incurred when you ordered.\n<br><strong>3. Inspection and Refund: </strong>We will notify you once we’ve received and inspected your return and let you know if the refund was approved. If approved, you’ll be automatically refunded. Please note that we will refund back to the original method of payment charged only (e.g., credit card, debit card, PayPal) and this will take 2-10 days, depending on the bank."
    },
